SteamGuardAccount format, the authenticator linking flow, and the mobile
confirmation (mobileconf) flow — is a native C# port of "SteamAuth" by
Joshua Coffey / geel9 (https://github.com/geel9/SteamAuth), the library the
original Steam Desktop Authenticator was built on. SteamAuth is released under
